	order_index: 0
	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"## <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.6>简介</grad></shadow>"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是一个融合了</grad></shadow><grad from=#4DDB58 to=#C1F5C5 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>泰拉瑞亚风格</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、内容丰富的</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC438 to=#FFE4A3 f=0.8>整合包，旨在为</grad></shadow><grad from=#4DDB58 to=#C1F5C5 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>Minecraft</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>带来全新的成长方式和冒险体验。</grad></shadow>"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>任务书</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8>是你的主要指南。它将引导你了解各种功能、机制和进阶路线，让你不会迷失方向。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.6>你需要知道的事情</grad></shadow>"
				"&l<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8>仅限首领解锁的进度：</grad></shadow>&r <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你无法立即制作所有东西。击败首领会解锁大量新内容。</grad></shadow>"
				"&l<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8>独特难度系统：</grad></shadow>&r <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>游戏开始时选择的难度将发生巨大变化。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>例如：</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>- </grad></shadow><grad from=#42E3D9 to=#B0EBE7 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>FTB Essentials</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>冷却时间与难度成正比增加。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>- </grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#49FF38 to=#9FFF96 f=0.8>招架</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会随着难度增加而变得更难。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>本整合包包含一个 </grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#DB762E to=#D9A37E f=0.8>独特的进度系统</grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，建议查看主进度任务线。</grad></shadow>"
			]
