		{
			dependencies: ["19237C5BA8DDB6AF"]
			description: [
				"与好友组队，在多人模式中共同完成任务，并分享进度。你可以在物品栏屏幕的顶部角落找到派对管理图标。"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FF9E1F f=0.6>1. 打开团队菜单</grad></shadow>"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>打开你的物品栏，然后点击团队图标。</grad></shadow>"
				"{image:customtextures:textures/team1.png width:300 height:150 align:center}"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FF9E1F f=0.6>2. 创建你的队伍</grad></shadow>"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>点击按钮以开始一个新的派对小组。</grad></shadow>"
				"{image:customtextures:textures/team2.png width:300 height:140 align:center}"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FF9E1F f=0.6>3. 设置名称和描述</grad></shadow>"
				"<c1><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>为您的队伍输入自定义名称和简短描述。</grad></c1>"
				"{image:customtextures:textures/team3.png width:300 height:200 align:center}"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FF9E1F f=0.6>4. 邀请你的朋友</grad></shadow>"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>使用玩家列表向服务器上的好友发送邀请。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "ftblibrary:icons/friends"
				}
			}
