			title: "<grad from=#FF91F0 to=#FF91F0>多人游戏：</grad><grad from=#FFD791 to=#FFD791> 队伍"
			x: 3.5d
			y: -6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19237C5BA8DDB6AF"]
			description: [
				"<grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>闪避系统与移动</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>闪避是通过按下 </grad></shadow><grad from=#00960B to=#38BA43 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>R</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>键实现的。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"激活后，会提供一个短暂的无敌帧窗口，让你能完全规避即将到来的伤害。它也可以在空中使用，是快速重新定位或穿越险地的好工具。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>该机制自带冷却时间，无法滥用。不过，某些附魔可以减少此冷却时间，或增强闪避本身，使其未来变得更实用。</grad></shadow><grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>冷却时间</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>"
				""
				"{image:customtextures:textures/dodge.png width:300 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>-➤ 滑动到下一页查看招架技巧。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"<grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>招架系统</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>招架是通过按下 </grad></shadow><grad from=#00960B to=#38BA43 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>F</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>键实现的。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>反射来袭的攻击，让你免受伤害，同时</grad></shadow><grad from=#6DE32D to=#BDDEAB f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>向攻击者反击</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>造成伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>连续格挡的次数越多，效果越强，最终可提升至%HP的伤害。与闪避一样，也存在</grad></shadow><grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>冷却时间</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，所以请务必把握好时机。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>该机制自带冷却时间，无法被滥用。</grad></shadow><grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3></grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{image:customtextures:textures/parry.png width:250 height:125 align:center}"
			]
			icon: {
