		{
			dependencies: ["19237C5BA8DDB6AF"]
			description: [
				"<grad from=#1FFFF0 to=#1FFFF0><shadow a=0.3>FTB Essentials</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 提供了各种各样的 </grad></shadow><grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>实用命令</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，让你的游戏体验更流畅，生存不再那么令人沮丧。"
				""
				"<grad from=#BD0000 to=#BD2B2B f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>冷却时间会根据你选择的难度而有所不同。</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"## <grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>杂项命令</shadow></grad>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/kickme</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 将你踢出服务器（如果床虫回来了，这个很有用）。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/trashcan</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 打开一个物品栏界面，关闭后其中放置的任何物品都会被永久删除。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/hat</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 将主手物品装备到头盔栏位中。"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/nick</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 更改你在聊天中的显示昵称。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"## <grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>作弊指令</shadow></grad>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/heal</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 将你的生命值和饱食度恢复到最大值。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/fly</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 切换创造模式飞行模式。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/invsee</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 打开并允许你编辑其他玩家的物品栏。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/nickfor</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 更改另一名玩家的聊天昵称。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/mute</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 在聊天中禁言一名玩家。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/unmute</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 解除玩家的聊天禁言状态。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/teleport_last</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 将你传送到玩家的最后一个已知位置。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"## <grad from=#FCE938 to=#FFF6A6 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>传送指令</shadow></grad>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/back</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 将你传回之前的位置。可多次使用以追溯你的脚步。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/spawn</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 将你传送到世界出生点。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/rtp</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 将你传送到世界中的一个随机安全位置（自动避开海洋）。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/home [name]</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 将你传送到预设的家园。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/sethome</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 将当前位置设为家。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/delhome</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 删除特定的家园。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/listhomes [player]</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 列出玩家的所有已注册家园。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/warp</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 将你传送到服务器的传送点。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/setwarp</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 在您的位置创建一个服务器传送点。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/delwarp</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 删除特定的传送点。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/listwarps</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 列出所有可用的服务器传送点。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/tpa</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 向其他玩家发送传送请求。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/tpahere</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 请求另一名玩家传送到你的位置。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/tpaccept [id]</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 接受待处理的传送请求（聊天框中也会出现可点击的按钮）。</grad></shadow>"
				"<grad from=#006EDB to=#3F91E0 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>/tpadeny [id]</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> - 拒绝待处理的传送请求。</grad></shadow>"
			]
