			description: ["<grad from=#787878 to=#787878><shadow a=0.3>探险家指南针</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>功能类似，但追踪的是</grad></shadow><grad from=#787878 to=#787878><shadow a=0.3>结构物</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>而非</grad></shadow><grad from=#50FF1F to=#50FF1F><shadow a=0.3>生物群系</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。你可以通过菜单搜索游戏中的任意</grad></shadow><grad from=#50FF1F to=#50FF1F><shadow a=0.3>生物群系</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，它会显示</grad></shadow><grad from=#CC0000 to=#D64242 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>距离</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>并指向最近的</grad></shadow><grad from=#CC0000 to=#D64242 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>坐标</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"]
