		{
			dependencies: ["19237C5BA8DDB6AF"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>护身符能完全免费地提供</grad></shadow><grad from=#D126D1 to=#D18AD1 f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>独特的增益效果，</shadow></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在世界的最开端就能获得，</grad></shadow><grad from=#6DE32D to=#BDDEAB f=0.8><shadow a=0.3>助你更好地度过</grad></grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>前期生存和发展的阶段。"
				""
