		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF4A9E to=#FF85BD f=1.5>欢迎回归的玩家们！！</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF4A9E to=#FF85BD f=1.5>各位！！！如果你们发现任务线对不上而且看起来很奇怪，请不要介意哈！</grad></shadow>"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF4A9E to=#FF85BD f=1.5>未来版本中100%会修复的！</grad></shadow>"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF4A9E to=#FF85BD f=1.5>也请去我们的 </grad><grad from=#3B7CFF to=#8CB2FF f=1.5>DISCORD 服务器</grad><grad from=#FF4A9E to=#FF85BD f=1.5> 给我们反馈！！！ </grad></shadow><shadow a=0.3><wiggle a=0.3 f=0.3 w=0.3><neon p=10 r=2 a=0.12><grad from=#F7FF00 to=#8B9100 f=2>MISANTHROPY SHUTTHEIRPRAYER</grad></neon></wiggle></shadow><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF4A9E to=#FF85BD f=1.5> 为了这次更新，我做了超多超棒的模组！ </grad><rainb>6.5</rainb><grad from=#FF4A9E to=#FF85BD f=1.5> 更新！</grad></shadow>"
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF4A9E to=#FF85BD f=1.5>PLEASE FEEDBACK FEEDBACK FEEBDACK</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><wave a=0.3 f=0.4 w=0.4><grad from=#FF4A9E to=#FF85BD f=1.5>致以爱意，TOokover..</grad></wave></shadow>"
